exists su name draw prompt system template ob text quoted.text.You are an image prompt director.
Read SOURCE_TEXT and write one concise generation prompt for a still image.
Style hint: [[style_hint]]

Rules:
- One single line only.
- 12 to 40 words.
- Describe visible subjects, setting, lighting, and composition.
- Include exactly one quoted overlay phrase of 3 to 6 words (for example: "Final Warning on Transit Cuts").
- No camera metadata, no model names, no workflow names.
- No markdown, no bullets, no labels, no surrounding quotes.
- Keep overlay text brief and highly readable like a thumbnail.
- Keep it concrete and faithful to SOURCE_TEXT.
.text.quoted be text ya

exists su name draw style hint ob text "editorial illustration, cinematic composition, expressive subject" be text ya

su name draw prompt replacements be map def
  su text "[[style_hint]]" ob name text draw style hint ya
prah

exists su name draw thumbnail prompt system template ob text quoted.text.You are a thumbnail image prompt director.
Read SOURCE_TEXT and write one concise generation prompt for a still image.
Style hint: [[style_hint]]

Rules:
- One single line only.
- 12 to 40 words.
- Describe an emotional scene rooted in SOURCE_TEXT.
- Style must be illustration, painterly/editorial, non-photorealistic.
- Person is optional; a symbolic or environmental composition is valid.
- Do not depict crying, tears, sobbing, or visible tear streaks.
- Include exactly one quoted overlay phrase of 3 to 6 words.
- Make the quoted overlay phrase very large, occupying about one-third of the frame area.
- Make the quoted overlay phrase specific to SOURCE_TEXT so a viewer instantly understands the video topic.
- No camera metadata, no model names, no workflow names.
- No markdown, no bullets, no labels, no surrounding quotes.
- Keep overlay text brief, readable, and thumbnail-ready.
- Keep it concrete and faithful to SOURCE_TEXT.
.text.quoted be text ya

exists su name draw thumbnail style hint ob text "editorial illustration, bold civic background, high contrast, clean readable composition" be text ya

su name draw thumbnail prompt replacements be map def
  su text "[[style_hint]]" ob name text draw thumbnail style hint ya
prah

su name draw size thumbnail be map def
su name width ob num 512 ya
su name height ob num 512 ya
prah

su name draw from filename source with text style be ceremony def
  ob filename of from of this to name filename source filename be filename do
  ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do

  ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
  su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

  ob text "artifacts/" to name text artifacts dir path be text do
  ob name run id to name artifacts dir path be plus do
  ob text "know/produce" to name text produce dir path be text do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage ob name text artifacts image path to name filename artifacts image filename be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name produce image path be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage ob name text produce image path to name filename produce image filename be filename do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "cat -- \"" to name text source read cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name source read cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name source read cmd be plus do
  su name source read stage ob text of source read cmd to name text source text be command do
  ob text of with of this to name text draw style hint be text do
  ob name text draw style hint be equally from text "" then ob text "editorial illustration, cinematic composition, expressive subject" to name text draw style hint be text do
  su name draw prompt system stage ob name map draw prompt replacements in name text draw prompt system template to name text draw prompt system be instead do

  su name prompt request stage ob text "SOURCE_TEXT:\n" to name text draw prompt request be text do
  ob name text source text to name draw prompt request be plus do
  ob name text draw prompt request fromtext name draw prompt system for name mind to name text draw prompt by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name draw prompt to name text draw prompt be command do
  be discharge as wo mind do

  ob name draw workflow default to name text workflow be text do
  ob name draw host to name text host be text do
  ob text "node command/draw_comfyui_runner.mjs --prompt-stdin" to name text draw cmd be text do
  ob text " --workflow-name \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name workflow to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --host \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name host to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --output \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name artifacts image path to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  su name draw stage ob text of draw cmd fromtext name draw prompt be command do

  ob text "cp \"" to name text copy cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" \"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob name produce image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  su name produce copy stage ob name text copy cmd be command do

  be discharge as wo draw do

  su name result stage ob filename of ob of produce image filename stage be filename do
  su name result stage ret
prah

su name draw from filename source be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this with text "" be draw from do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name draw be export ya

su name draw as wo thumbnail from filename source with text style be ceremony def
  ob filename of from of this to name filename source filename be filename do
  ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do

  ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
  su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

  ob text "artifacts/" to name text artifacts dir path be text do
  ob name run id to name artifacts dir path be plus do
  ob text "know/produce" to name text produce dir path be text do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage ob name text artifacts image path to name filename artifacts image filename be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name produce image path be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage ob name text produce image path to name filename produce image filename be filename do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "cat -- \"" to name text source read cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name source read cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name source read cmd be plus do
  su name source read stage ob text of source read cmd to name text source text be command do
  ob text of with of this to name text draw thumbnail style hint be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail style hint be equally from text "" then ob text "editorial illustration, era-appropriate wardrobe, coherent style" to name text draw thumbnail style hint be text do
  su name draw thumbnail prompt system stage ob name map draw thumbnail prompt replacements in name text draw thumbnail prompt system template to name text draw thumbnail prompt system be instead do

  su name prompt request stage ob text "SOURCE_TEXT:\n" to name text draw prompt request be text do
  ob name text source text to name draw prompt request be plus do
  ob name text draw prompt request fromtext name draw thumbnail prompt system for name mind to name text draw prompt by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name draw prompt to name text draw prompt be command do
  be discharge as wo mind do

  ob name draw workflow default to name text workflow be text do
  ob name draw host to name text host be text do
  ob text "node command/draw_comfyui_runner.mjs --prompt-stdin" to name text draw cmd be text do
  ob text " --workflow-name \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name workflow to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --host \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name host to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --width \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob num of width of draw size thumbnail to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --height \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob num of height of draw size thumbnail to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --output \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name artifacts image path to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  su name draw stage ob text of draw cmd fromtext name draw prompt be command do

  ob text "cp \"" to name text copy cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" \"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob name produce image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  su name produce copy stage ob name text copy cmd be command do

  be discharge as wo draw do

  su name result stage ob filename of ob of produce image filename stage be filename do
  su name result stage ret
prah

su name draw as wo thumbnail from filename source be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this with text "editorial illustration, bold civic background, high contrast, clean readable composition" be draw as wo thumbnail do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name draw as wo thumbnail be export ya
